  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Artists' book and accompanying booklet are accordion-folded sheets in goatskin vellum folder, housed in acrylic slipcase.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Poem and booklet printed with photoplymer plates by letterpress; artwork hand painted in gouache with pochoir stencils.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Signed by artist.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"... printed by letterpress in an edition of 150 copies, with 30 hors commerce numbered from A to DD. The vellum cover was freely hand-painted with acrylic paint. ... digital scans manipulated by printer Robert Seibert, who printed all parts of the project." -- Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
